%N A398344 Smallest positive number that can be written in exactly n ways as a sum or a difference of two squares > 0.
%e A398344 For n = 4, a(4) = 45 because 45 = 3^2+6^2 = 7^2-2^2 = 9^2-6^2 = 23^2-22^2.
%Y A398344 Cf. A047696 (the same with cubes), A016032 (with only sum of squares), A094191 (with only difference of squares).
